  "body": "Solid Brick, Stunning Views & Steps to the Marina, Set on an impressive 971m2 freehold site, this substantial Half Moon Bay home combines generous family living, flexibility and water views in a location families love.\r\n\r\nDesigned with space and flexibility in mind, the upper level features a large lounge capturing beautiful views, along with a generous open-plan kitchen and dining area. \r\nA fantastic wraparound balcony extends from the master bedroom right around to the living areas, creating the perfect place to relax, entertain and enjoy the outlook.\r\n\r\nThe master suite includes its own ensuite, while two additional bedrooms are serviced by a spacious family bathroom with a separate toilet. Excellent storage throughout adds to the home's practicality.\r\n\r\nDownstairs offers even more versatility, featuring a fourth bedroom, a large rumpus room and a full bathroom. Whether you have teenagers, extended family or simply need additional living space, this layout provides plenty of options.\r\n\r\nSet back from the road on an elevated, generous site, the property also offers a double internal-access garage and ample off-street parking. Outside, the substantial freehold section provides the kind of space that's becoming increasingly difficult to find. There's room for children, pets and outdoor living, giving families the freedom and flexibility to really make this property their own.\r\n\r\nFor buyers searching for space, water views, flexibility and a substantial piece of Half Moon Bay real estate, this is a property that needs to be seen.\r\n\r\nProperty highlights:\r\n\r\n* Solid brick construction\r\n* Four generous bedrooms, including master with ensuite\r\n* Large downstairs rumpus room\r\n* Three bathrooms plus separate toilet\r\n* Spacious lounge with stunning elevated views\r\n* Generous open-plan kitchen and dining\r\n* Wraparound balcony connecting the master suite and living areas\r\n* Double internal-access garage\r\n* Ample off-street parking\r\n* Excellent storage throughout\r\n* Generous elevated site\r\n* Just a five-minute walk to the marina\r\n* Bus stop right outside for added convenience\r\n\r\nWith the marina, waterfront walks and local amenities just moments away, this is a location that offers an exceptional lifestyle.\r\n\r\nSolid brick, substantial space and a sought-after marina location - this is an opportunity not to be missed!\r\n\r\nWe look forward to welcoming you through the open homes or feel free to contact us to arrange a private viewing.\r\n\r\nAuction: Bucklands Beach Yacht Club on Tuesday 1 December 2026 at 6:00PM (unless sold prior)",
